* Noteworthy changes in release ?.? (????-??-??) [?]

** New features

  A full-screen interface with a menu bar (F9), a function-key bar,
  pages to switch between with 1-9, Alt-1..9 and Ctrl-PgUp/PgDn, and
  four color themes: classic, blue, dark and mono.

  The Overview page shows the host and system, uptime, load, and the
  use of the processors, memory and swap with their recent history.

  The --demo option shows simulated data, and --once prints a
  plain-text report instead of starting the full-screen interface.

